Light filters authored with the UsdLux light:filters relationship on a referenced asset

see #2799

The asset is referenced under a deeper hierarchy than its own root, so the relationship
targets (and the gobo's slidemap connection) must be remapped by USD composition.
A decay filter and a gobo filter (with an image shader as slidemap) are tested.

author: cyril.pichard

PARAMS: {'scene': 'scene.usda'}
